                {
                  "type": 12,
                  "content": {
                    "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
                    "groupType": "editable",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "type": 1,
                        "content": {
                          "json": "### Delete Resource(s)\r\n\r\nTo delete resource(s), select the resource(s) from the table above and click the `⛔ Delete Selected Resource(s)` button below.",
